WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Somewhere beyond the meridian, a signal waits.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
It has been waiting for a very long time.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Tonight, someone finally answers.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
This is where the story begins.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Every vault holds more than it appears to.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
And some doors only open from the inside.
